<title>UK: London silver fixes slightly lower at 475.00 cts.</title>
<headline>London silver fixes slightly lower at 475.00 cts.</headline>
<text>
<p>SILVER - Fixed at 475.00 cents vs 477.00 cents previously. Very quiet after several recent failures on upside. Seen in $4.70-$4.80 range.</p>
<p>GOLD - $337.30/$337.70 vs $337.90/$338.40 close. Offlow onshort covering. Biased to downside test.</p>
<p>PLATINUM - Steady at $418.00/$423.00 vs $417.00/$422.00.</p>
<p>PALLADIUM - Also steady at $193.50/$198.50 vs $196.00/$201.00.</p>
</text>
